THE HEAD OF UKRAINE'S RAILWAY

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:39.239 line:0%
SYSTEM HAS DUBBED THE TRIP WILL

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:41.341 line:0%
FORCE ONE NOW SAYING IT WAS AN

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:42.475 line:0%
HONOR TO HOST A BIDEN WHILE

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.676 line:0%
ACKNOWLEDGING THAT IT WAS QUITE

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:48.314 line:0%
A COMPLICATED JOURNEY TO GET

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:51.451 line:0%
THE PRESIDENT ON THE PLANE AND

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:52.619 line:0%
ALEXANDER APOLOGIZED FOR THE

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.387 line:0%
FRACKING RAILWAY ON TIME

00:00:52.786 --> 00:00:57.290 line:0%
PERFORMANCE SAYING STILL 90% OF

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.691 line:0%
THE TRAIN ON THAT SECRET TRIP

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:59.292 line:0%
AS IT WAS GOING ON DID OPERATE

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:00.293 line:0%
ON TIME.

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:01.428 line:0%
HE SAID IT WAS PAINFUL FOR ME

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.296 line:0%
MY TEAM BUT I HAD TO DO THAT

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.464 line:0%
POLLING 90% OF OUR TRAINS

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.931 line:0%
DERIVED ON TIME YESTERDAY.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:07.534 line:0%
I APOLOGIZE.

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:08.535 line:0%
I SPOKE WITH ALEXANDER JUST

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.935 line:0%
BEFORE THE PROGRAM THIS

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:12.372 line:0%
MORNING.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:16.309 line:0%
&gt;&gt; JOINING ME NOW IS THE CEO OF

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:16.743 line:0%
UKRAINIAN RAILWAYS, ALEXANDER

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:17.477 line:0%
COMMOTION.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.044 line:0%
ALEXANDER, THANK YOU SO MUCH

00:01:17.644 --> 00:01:19.579 line:0%
FOR BEING WITH US.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.347 line:0%
WE KNOW YOU HAD QUITE A WEEK.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.415 line:0%
WHEN DID YOU FIND OUT THAT

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.516 line:0%
PRESIDENT BIDEN WAS COMING

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:26.286 line:0%
THAT'S GOING TO BE RIDING ON

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:29.456 line:0%
ONE OF YOUR TRAINS?

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:33.359 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE WERE VERY HAPPY TO BRING

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:35.495 line:0%
HIM IN AND OUT WITH THIS VISIT.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:36.629 line:0%
I'M SURE THAT WAS A HISTORICAL

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:39.265 line:0%
MOMENT FOR UKRAINE, FOR U.S.,

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:41.267 line:0%
FOR THE WHOLE WORLD BECAUSE IF

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:44.337 line:0%
YOU REMEMBER, RUSSIAN PROMISED

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:48.441 line:0%
TO TAKE IN THE --

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:51.478 line:0%
FALL IN THE 62ND DAY OF THE WAR

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:51.945 line:0%
PRESIDENT BIDEN WILL

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:55.949 line:0%
[INAUDIBLE]

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.516 line:0%
IT IS KIND OF A REALLY

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:59.119 line:0%
HISTORICAL MOMENT.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:02:01.154 line:0%
WE WERE HAPPY AND PRIVILEGED

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:03.923 line:0%
AND HONORED TO BE THE OFFICIAL

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:08.061 line:0%
CARRIER OF THE PRESIDENT BIDEN

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.495 line:0%
SO WE CALLED HOUR TRAIN RAIL

00:02:08.228 --> 00:02:10.196 line:0%
FORCE ONE.

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.297 line:0%
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHTER]

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.032 line:0%
THAT IS WHY YOU HAVE DUBBED IT

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:17.003 line:0%
NOW THAT PRESIDENT BIDEN HAS

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:19.105 line:0%
NEVER BEEN ON BOARD.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:21.174 line:0%
DO &gt;&gt; YES.

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:23.042 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU TALK TO MY COLLEAGUE

00:02:21.341 --> 00:02:24.244 line:0%
ANDERSON COOPER ABOUT A YEAR

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.979 line:0%
AGO WHEN YOU TOLD HIM THEN THAT

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.213 line:0%
YOU ARE READY TO HOST PRESIDENT

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.680 line:0%
BIDEN IF HE WAS GOING TO COME

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.049 line:0%
TO UKRAINE.

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:30.683 line:0%
YOU ARE READY FOR HIM TO TRAVEL

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.384 line:0%
TO ONE OF YOUR CARDS.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.519 line:0%
WHEN YOU FOUND OUT HE WAS

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:33.086 line:0%
ACTUALLY COMING, WHERE YOU KIND

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:38.591 line:0%
OF NERVOUS?

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:41.728 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I WAS NOT NERVOUS BUT

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:43.830 line:0%
FOCUSED AND DETERMINED UNTIL

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:45.698 line:0%
THE MOMENT HE LEFT THE BORDER

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:47.734 line:0%
OF UKRAINE BECAUSE TRUST ME IT

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:50.670 line:0%
WAS A COMPLICATED MISSION AND

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:52.672 line:0%
WE GOT A PRETTY MUCH A BIG JOB

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:53.873 line:0%
TO DO TO MAKE IT HAPPEN IN A

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.807 line:0%
PROPER WAY AND WE HAVE DONE IT.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.875 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHAT KIND OF PREPARATION

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.644 line:0%
GOES INTO THAT?

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:58.745 line:0%
HOW DO YOU PREPARE TO HOST A

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.113 line:0%
U.S. PRESIDENT IN SUCH A

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.480 line:0%
DANGEROUS TIME AND DANGEROUS

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.983 line:0%
PLACE?

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:07.554 line:0%
&gt;&gt; [INAUDIBLE]

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:12.325 line:0%
WE WANT TO HAND IN HAND WITH

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:13.092 line:0%
THE EMBASSY OF U.S., UKRAINE

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.594 line:0%
WALKED HAND-IN-HAND WITH OTHER

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.396 line:0%
SPECIAL SERVICES FROM U.S., AND

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:17.830 line:0%
FROM UKRAINIAN SIDE, DID MR.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.766 line:0%
THE INFRASTRUCTURE OF UKRAINE

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.200 line:0%
AND FINALLY WE GOT THE JOB

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:23.336 line:0%
DONE.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:24.437 line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU ALSO HOSTED OTHER WORLD

00:03:23.503 --> 00:03:25.471 line:0%
LEADERS, EVERY WORLD LEADER

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.673 line:0%
THAT HAS COME TO UKRAINE HAS

00:03:25.638 --> 00:03:27.640 line:0%
TRAVELED ON ONE OF YOUR TRAINS

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.410 line:0%
GETTING INTO KYIV.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:32.312 line:0%
WHAT IS THE RESPONSIBILITY LIKE

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.879 line:0%
TO HAVE PEOPLE LIKE THAT ON

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:41.221 line:0%
YOUR TRAINS?

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:42.222 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE GOT ABOUT 300 OFFICIAL

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.323 line:0%
DELEGATIONS WITH WORLDWIDE

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:45.024 line:0%
LEADERS, PRESIDENTS, PRIME

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:47.193 line:0%
MINISTERS, MEMBERS OF

00:03:45.191 --> 00:03:50.230 line:0%
PARLIAMENT, OF THE CONGRESS AND

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.231 line:0%
IT'S REALLY RESPONSIBLE MISSION

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:55.001 line:0%
FOR US.

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.435 line:0%
WE CALL THIS MISSION IRON

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.003 line:0%
DIPLOMACY.

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:59.105 line:0%
THAT IS HOW WE HELP OUR

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:00.340 line:0%
PRESIDENT TO MAKE HIS

00:03:59.272 --> 00:04:06.646 line:0%
DIPLOMATIC MISSION HAPPEN.

00:04:02.842 --> 00:04:07.780 line:0%
EVERY SINGLE GUEST OF IRON

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:08.748 line:0%
DIPLOMACY PROGRAM IS A HONORED

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:11.651 line:0%
GUEST FOR US.

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:13.853 line:0%
WE DO OUR BEST TO BRING THEM IN

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:14.921 line:0%
AND OUT SAFELY.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:16.823 line:0%
THAT IS FIRST OF ALL.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:18.791 line:0%
SECOND, WE TRY TO SHOW THEM

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:21.628 line:0%
WHAT IS UKRAINE BECAUSE THEY

00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:23.930 line:0%
USUALLY SPEND, ON THE TRAIN,

00:04:21.794 --> 00:04:26.633 line:0%
MUCH MORE TIME THAN ON THE CITY

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:27.934 line:0%
AND THAT WAS THE SAME THING

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:29.736 line:0%
WITH PRESIDENT BIDEN AS WELL.

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.703 line:0%
HE SPENT 20 HOURS ON THE TRAIN

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.070 line:0%
AND ONLY FOUR HOURS IN THE

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.705 line:0%
CITY.

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:34.774 line:0%
WE TRY TO DO OUR BEST TO MAKE

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:38.711 line:0%
THEIR TRIP UNFORGETTABLE.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.447 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IT IS QUITE A TRIP.

00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:41.881 line:0%
IT'S 20 HOURS WITH BOTH WAYS

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.682 line:0%
INCLUDED.

00:04:42.415 --> 00:04:45.485 line:0%
RUSSIA --

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:46.786 line:0%
THE RUSSIANS HAVE STRUCK THE

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:48.588 line:0%
TRAINS BEFORE THE TRAIN TRACKS,

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.389 line:0%
ARE YOU EVER WORRIED ABOUT

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:49.889 line:0%
RETALIATION WHEN SOMETHING LIKE

00:04:49.555 --> 00:04:54.460 line:0%
THIS HAPPENS?

00:04:53.626 --> 00:05:00.633 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE ARE [INAUDIBLE]

00:04:57.397 --> 00:05:02.702 line:0%
THEY TELL US DAILY SO WE KIND

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.570 line:0%
OF KNOW WHAT TO DO NOW AND WE

00:05:02.869 --> 00:05:07.874 line:0%
ARE READY FOR THAT.

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:08.708 line:0%
WE ALWAYS FIX, ALWAYS GET BACK

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:10.910 line:0%
TO OPERATIONS.

00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:11.411 line:0%
WE NEVER, STOP NEVER CANCEL ANY

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:15.848 line:0%
SINGLE TRAIN.

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:16.649 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ONE MOST REMARKABLE THINGS

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:18.151 line:0%
YOU SAID YESTERDAY WHEN YOU ARE

00:05:16.816 --> 00:05:20.253 line:0%
TALKING ABOUT THE COMPLICATED

00:05:18.318 --> 00:05:21.321 line:0%
PROCESS OF GETTING BIDEN INTO

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.455 line:0%
KYIV ON ONE OF YOUR TRAINS WAS

00:05:21.487 --> 00:05:25.124 line:0%
YOU APOLOGIZED TO OTHER PEOPLE

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:27.126 line:0%
TO TAKE UKRAINIAN RAILWAYS

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:28.361 line:0%
SAYING THAT ONLY 90% OF THE

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:29.462 line:0%
TRAINS WERE ON TIME YESTERDAY.

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:31.364 line:0%
I THINK EVERY ONE COULD GIVE

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:32.498 line:0%
YOU A PASS FOR THIS ONE GIVEN

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:33.333 line:0%
YOU WERE ACCOMMODATING THE U.S.

00:05:32.665 --> 00:05:36.002 line:0%
PRESIDENT ON SUCH A SECRET

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:40.206 line:0%
VISIT.

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:42.241 line:0%
&gt;&gt; FOR US ON TIME PERFORMANCE,

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:44.944 line:0%
IT IS REALLY IMPORTANT FOCUS.

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:47.180 line:0%
DURING THE WAR, PEOPLE SHOULD

00:05:45.111 --> 00:05:49.949 line:0%
RELY ON SOMETHING.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.950 line:0%
WE ALWAYS BECAME A RELIABLE

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:52.185 line:0%
TRANSPORTATION FOR OUR PEOPLE

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:54.987 line:0%
AND THAT IS WHY WE HAD TO DELAY

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:57.123 line:0%
SOME TRAINS TO MAKE THE RAIL

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:57.824 line:0%
FORCE ONE RUN SMOOTHLY AND

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.926 line:0%
SAFELY.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:01.994 line:0%
I HAD TO APOLOGIZE BECAUSE WE

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:04.063 line:0%
USUALLY STRIVE TO BE AT A

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:05.732 line:0%
BETTER PERFORMANCE BUT TWO DAYS

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:10.770 line:0%
AGO, IT WAS NOT GOOD.

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.938 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE WAR HAS HAD SUCH AN

00:06:10.937 --> 00:06:13.773 line:0%
IMPACT ON YOU, PERSONALLY.

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:15.675 line:0%
YOU HAVE BEEN TRYING TO KEEP

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:18.745 line:0%
THE TRAINS RUNNING AS YOU WERE

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:20.847 line:0%
NOTING AS A SOURCE OF

00:06:18.911 --> 00:06:21.781 line:0%
TRANSPORTATION FOR MANY

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:24.016 line:0%
UKRAINIANS, YOU DID IT TO YOUR

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:24.884 line:0%
FAMILY WAS AT THE BEGINNING OF

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.852 line:0%
THE WAR.

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:27.487 line:0%
HOW ARE YOU DOING?

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:33.926 line:0%
LOOK &gt;&gt; [INAUDIBLE]

00:06:30.857 --> 00:06:36.963 line:0%
I HAVE A PERSONAL IMPACT AND

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:39.932 line:0%
LIKE MANY UKRAINIANS, THAT IS

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:41.934 line:0%
REALLY SIGNIFICANT AND A HIGH

00:06:40.099 --> 00:06:45.905 line:0%
PRICE WE ARE PAYING IN THIS WAR.

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:48.074 line:0%
WE ARE MISSING OUR FAMILIES AND

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:50.076 line:0%
HAVING A FIGHT IN THIS WAR.

00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:55.047 line:0%
FINALLY, I AM SURE THAT ONE DAY

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:55.381 line:0%
